{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"states\": [\n    {\n      \"shot\": 1,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他很喜欢对方，想把能给的都给对方，让对方安心，也舍不得分开，想再多陪一会儿，最后决定不再藏着喜欢。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"深情、眷恋、急切、狂喜，夹着不安\",\n      \"missed\": \"歌声如何推动情绪、内声部彼此拉扯、狂喜像高烧和久别重逢，以及喉咙发紧、眼眶湿了等身体感受，需要读小字才能获得。右侧前六个阶段的具体变化也不容易一眼读全。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 2,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他不确定未来能不能一直这么好，却还是觉得陪伴不够，想继续靠近对方，最终放开自己，坦然地喜欢对方。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"眷恋、贪恋、不满足、欢喜、释然\",\n      \"missed\": \"最容易漏掉的是他对未来的不确定和隐约害怕失去的心理。中间段落虽然字号很大，但一句话包含了好几层意思；歌声近乎恳求的感觉也需要读下面的小字才能抓到。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    },\n    {\n      \"shot\": 3,\n      \"grasp_who\": \"他终于不再克制自己的喜欢，想把心意充分表达出来，也想尽可能多陪伴对方。\",\n      \"grasp_feel\": \"高兴、热烈、眷恋、放开、坦然\",\n      \"missed\": \"容易只留下最后的痛快和喜欢，而没有完整抓到此前的单向付出、对未来的担忧，以及从害怕失去到不再猜测的心理转变。右侧阶段列表仍需要逐条读。\",\n      \"score\": 3\n    }\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3,\n  \"link\": 4,\n  \"main_problem\": \"三段大字的情绪和事件其实能连成一条清楚的线：想把一切给对方、舍不得相处时间不够、最后不再压抑喜欢。主要负担在于每段主句都偏长，一句话里塞了好几层心理变化；右侧又有七条阶段词，形成第二套阅读路径。扫一眼容易抓到‘给对方、想陪伴、痛快地喜欢’，但‘不确定对方是否在乎、害怕以后不再这么好’这层不安相对容易被跳过。三张图下方动画虽然持续变化，但主要提供音乐流动和起伏的视觉感，不会改变人物故事的理解。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "5e9cbccd-14e8-4ec8-a0cd-c2460af57441", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261109T224449498822Z", "elapsed_seconds": 74.719, "completed_utc": "2026-11-09T22:46:04.223101+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "f288c9fb954a91b537fa3187038b4968d6a798fc455e0cc5d6012b459dff6ec8", "attachment_count": 3}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 3, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261109T224449498822Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "3af65c5bea564949bb9294dda8ddf0ac23709c9b8b98755681f043942b2ea136"}}}
